{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Game</strong><br><strong>Flee the Fallen Demo</strong> is a limited preview of the upcoming 2D zombie metroidvania <strong>Flee the Fallen</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can explore a small section of the infected world, fight zombies with basic weapons, and complete a handful of quests while solving early-game puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supported in this demo:</strong><br>Single-player<br>Action combat, exploration, light puzzles and questing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some weapons, areas, and advanced features shown in the full game are <strong>not available</strong> in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872410/extras/56e311f6db8d429b86cc2f76e9b1524c.poster.avif?t=1753151875\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872410/extras/56e311f6db8d429b86cc2f76e9b1524c.webm?t=1753151875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872410/extras/56e311f6db8d429b86cc2f76e9b1524c.mp4?t=1753151875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872410?t=1753151875","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872410/d6005a7ff17dee39b7def5adedd473efccba1151/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753151875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872410/e60dffb682d6e3a7a4d0dadd123c5718927f3b32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753151875","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872410/e60dffb682d6e3a7a4d0dadd123c5718927f3b32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753151875","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description